        <mxCell id="l1_scope_note" value="&lt;b&gt;Scope and role boundary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;SIBAT/CBAT verify selected records in assigned scope; MAO/Admin makes the final municipal decision. Farmer production logs are personal and are not in this approval queue. Review metadata is stored per domain, not in one shared history table. GIS, data uploads, announcements and program schedules are portal functions outside this core-workflow decomposition." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=18;fillColor=#fff8db;strokeColor=#c9a227;fontColor=#3f3b2b;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
